A tale of two startups.

I started using coderabbit for ai reviews two weeks ago and applied to their startup program, paying for a couple of seats

@coderabbitai took many days to reply, and then said i wouldn't qualify because I didn't raise VC funding, kind of a cold email too

Decided to check out their competition

@greptile responded within an hour and happily gave me the startup discount, very polite and excited email! 

Moving over now and highly recommend everyone else does too!
